  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Welcome to Cottage Fever in Laurel Grove – Where Comfort Meets Coastal Cool <br><br>Escape to a serene slice of the Florida Panhandle, where cottage charm meets resort living. Nestled along the award-winning Raven Golf Club, Cottage Fever offers pine-lined walks, and vibrant coastal décor inspired by the emerald-green waters of Sandestin®.<br><br>Enjoy:<br>• Spacious open-concept living with tree views from nearly every window<br>• A modern eat-in kitchen, perfect for gathering or relaxing<br>• Two private king suites and a cozy upstairs guest room with double beds<br>• Full bathrooms for every bedroom, perfect for guests and families<br>• A complimentary 6-passenger golf cart to explore the entire resort<br><br>Adventure Awaits!<br>Take the cart to Baytowne™ Wharf for dining, shopping, and year-round events. Explore Jolee Island’s nature trails or tunnel your way to the resort beach and sink your toes into that iconic sugar-white sand.<br><br>After beach time:<br>• Cool off in the Laurel Grove pool or nearby Phil Hummel Aquatic Center<br>• Join a game at the tennis courts, or tee off for a round of golf<br>Whether it’s lunch back at the cottage or a seafood bite to the sounds of live music in Baytowne™, Cottage Fever is your home base for the perfect Florida escape.<br><br>Important Guest Information<br>Sandestin Beach Access Update – <br>Effective May 1, 2025, Sandestin Golf & Beach Resort has implemented a paid parking policy for all vehicles, including golf carts, at the resort’s beach access point. The daily parking fee is $20, and guests will pay Sandestin directly for parking.<br>Rental Agreement Requirement-<br>After booking confirmation, you will receive a Rental Agreement via email, sent as an E-Sign document with required signature fields.<br>The Rental Agreement must be signed before your arrival instructions are released.<br>________________________________________<br>No Pets. No Smoking.<br>Managed by Russell Vacation Rentals. Construction in nearby areas may occur.<br><br>Walton STR23-1047<br>Walton Tax 7965<br><br>Property Details:<br>3 Bedroom 3 Bath - Sleeps 8<br><br>Primary Owner's Suite with King Bed<br>Guest Bedroom with King Bed<br>Guest Bedroom with 2 Double Beds en suite Bath withTub/Shower<br>Standard and Keurig Coffee Makers<br>Flat Screen TVs<br>XBOX 360 & Games<br>Washer/Dryer<br>Golf cart- 6 passenger<br>Free Wifi<br>Satellite/Cable TV/DVD Player<br>Community Pool, Clubhouse, Fitness Room <br>Propane Gas Grill<br>Private beach access w/open lot parking<br>Fee-based resort activities: golf, tennis, rentals, spa, & fitness center<br>Easy Self Check-In",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Laurel Grove, Walk to Pool, 6-Seat Golf Cart"
        }
